            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[NUPHY-RELEASE-NOTES 1
version:1.2.43
[zh-CN]
NuPhy Lab 1.2.43

• 新增模拟声浪：麻将、奶油、木质、轻柔、段落和复古六类，每类三款声音。
• 支持后台打字播放、独立音量、自然变化与大键声音调节；仅在开启后使用输入监听。
[en]
NuPhy Lab 1.2.43

• Add Typing Sounds with three sounds each in six families: Marbly, Creamy, Woody, Soft, Tactile and Retro.
• Play sounds while typing in other apps, with volume, natural variation and large-key controls; input monitoring is used only while enabled.
